<p>Hello everyone! It’s quite an honor (to me at least xD) to finally be apart of the creative minds of SCP. Been a fan of SCP for approximately 5-6 years now, back when I thought they were real and got myself scared. Anyways I hope to learn everything there is to this site and to meet the admins and mods.</p>
<p>But now to properly introduce myself, my name is Ethan and I live in Australia but New-Zealand born. I love to game in my free time (cliche I know) but I also love watching movies, especially marvel movies. I am currently fresh out of high school and on my way to study computer science at uni.</p>
<p>My main endeavor joining this creative writing group was to maybe practice my creative writing skills and ultimately craft my very own SCP. However I am also quite intrigued by the SCP fandom/lore and do wish to learn more about that as well.</p>
<p>Lastly I may or may not need help navigating around this site cause my brain is fried. I think that is all, stay safe, keep writing and I hope to see you around.<br />
Thank-you.</p>

